{
    "title": "BambooHR",
    "description": "BambooHR is the number one online HR software for small and medium-sized businesses that have outgrown spreadsheets. We automate many of the most tedious HR functions and free you up to do meaningful work. The BambooHR app lets you take some of those most important functions with you, and makes your most common tasks in BambooHR simple and fast.\r\n\r\n* In order to do anything with the BambooHR app you will need a current BambooHR account. Find out more and start a free trial at BambooHR.com.\r\n\r\nCompany Directory, Everywhere You Go\r\n\r\nYour company\u2019s phone numbers, emails, photos, titles\u2014your whole company directory goes wherever you do.\r\n\r\n* See colleague\u2019s information and call, email, or message them with a tap\r\n* Quickly add someone\u2019s info to your phone\u2019s contacts\r\n\r\nPlan and Manage Time Off\r\n\r\nPlanning a trip? Request time off when you\u2019re out and about. Leave requests can be submitted in the app, and if you\u2019re an approver, you can approve them there as well.\r\n\r\n* See who\u2019s out of the office today and on any future date\r\n* See current and calculate your future time off balances\r\n* Submit, view, edit, and comment on your time off requests\r\n* See available balances on your PTO types while requesting time off\r\n* Approve and deny time off requests\r\n* Push notifications keep you in the loop on the status of your requests\r\n\r\nMore Juicy Details:\r\n\r\n* Passcode protection will help keep your information secure.\r\n* Full SAML Single Sign-On support\r\n* The app is customized with your company color to help you feel a little more at home\r\n* Filter the directory and calendar by your department, division, or location\r\n* And so much more!\r\n\r\nWe always love to hear what you think. Please send your thoughts, comments and suggestions to android@bamboohr.com\r\n\r\nHappy Bamboo-ing!",
    "descriptionHTML": "BambooHR is the number one online HR software for small and medium-sized businesses that have outgrown spreadsheets. We automate many of the most tedious HR functions and free you up to do meaningful work. The BambooHR app lets you take some of those most important functions with you, and makes your most common tasks in BambooHR simple and fast.<br><br>* In order to do anything with the BambooHR app you will need a current BambooHR account. Find out more and start a free trial at BambooHR.com.<br><br>Company Directory, Everywhere You Go<br><br>Your company\u2019s phone numbers, emails, photos, titles\u2014your whole company directory goes wherever you do.<br><br>* See colleague\u2019s information and call, email, or message them with a tap<br>* Quickly add someone\u2019s info to your phone\u2019s contacts<br><br>Plan and Manage Time Off<br><br>Planning a trip? Request time off when you\u2019re out and about. Leave requests can be submitted in the app, and if you\u2019re an approver, you can approve them there as well.<br><br>* See who\u2019s out of the office today and on any future date<br>* See current and calculate your future time off balances<br>* Submit, view, edit, and comment on your time off requests<br>* See available balances on your PTO types while requesting time off<br>* Approve and deny time off requests<br>* Push notifications keep you in the loop on the status of your requests<br><br>More Juicy Details:<br><br>* Passcode protection will help keep your information secure.<br>* Full SAML Single Sign-On support<br>* The app is customized with your company color to help you feel a little more at home<br>* Filter the directory and calendar by your department, division, or location<br>* And so much more!<br><br>We always love to hear what you think. Please send your thoughts, comments and suggestions to android@bamboohr.com<br><br>Happy Bamboo-ing!",
